# Customer Health Project

This repository is the Tkxel Customer Health command center.

## Stack

- Frontend: Vite, React 18, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, React Router, TanStack Query, Recharts.
- Backend: dependency-free Python HTTP API under `backend/`, SQLite database, standard-library tests.
- Local API base: `http://127.0.0.1:8181`.
- Local frontend: `http://127.0.0.1:5173/login`.

## Run Commands

- Full stack: `npm run dev:full`
- Frontend only: `npm run dev:frontend`
- Backend only: `npm run dev:backend`
- Frontend typecheck: `npm run check`
- Backend tests: `python -m unittest discover -s backend\tests`

If Windows resolves `python` to the Microsoft Store stub, use the bundled Codex runtime documented in `backend/README.md`.

## Development Notes

- Keep frontend app work aligned with the existing prototype route in `src/app/prototype/CustomerHealthPrototype.tsx`.
- Keep backend API changes inside `backend/customer_health/` and add focused tests in `backend/tests/`.
- Do not commit `.env.local`, local log files, or generated server output.
- Seed admin login for local verification: `admin@customerhealth.test` / `Admin@123`.
- Prefer small, scoped changes that preserve the current dark command-center UI.
